    - uwp: planetoid belt
    - uwp: terrestrial
    - uwp: small gas giant
bases:
  - N
  - S</code></pre>
        </article>

        <article class='spec-card'>
          <h3>Using System Density</h3>
          <p>
            The system generator will assign stellar objects based on the system density; the higher the density, the
            higher the number of stellar objects generated. See <cite>Deepnight Revelation Referee Handbook, pg. 8</cite>.
          </p>
          <pre><code>name: ALS-BMM
primary:
  type: M6
  class: V
  close:
    type: M8
    class: V
counts:
  density: 12</code></pre>
        </article>

